OL,3,AFarmer who says 999 call foiled RAF
OL,4,AFairford plot only has 'partial
OL,5,Apicture', defence secretary tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FA farmer who called 999 when she saw "a
OL,8,Flarge group of hooded and masked men"
OL,9,Fnear RAF Fairford early on Sunday
OL,10,Fbelieves she "foiled" their plans
OL,12,FShe tells the Today programme she was
OL,13,Fcoming home from a party when a road
OL,14,Fwas blocked by "three white vans". She
OL,15,Fsaw a group of men run off, and called
OL,16,F999 at 01:36 BST
OL,18,FBut Defence Secretary Wes Streeting
OL,19,Fsays she only has a "partial picture",
OL,20,Fwhile declining to speculate on
OL,21,Fpossible Iranian links. Here's Frank
OL,22,FGardner's analysis
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
