OL,3,AFarmer who says 999 call foiled RAF
OL,4,AFairford plot only has 'partial
OL,5,Apicture', defence secretary tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne person who lives near the base
OL,8,Ftells us that local people were sent
OL,9,Fhome by armed police just hours before
OL,10,Fthe suspects were arrested - others say
OL,11,Fsecurity had ramped up days before
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
