OL,3,AUK diesel price hits all-time high, RAC
OL,4,Asays
OL,5,
OL,6,FRAC said diesel prices had entered
OL,7,F"uncharted territory" and served as a
OL,8,Freminder of "just how exposed the UK is
OL,9,Fto events occurring far away".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
